1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,062
Five things you must do in Bhutan.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:09,745
Do order ema datshi, chilies cooked in cheese, and ask for red rice on the side.

3
00:00:10,795 --> 00:00:13,330
Do visit Punakha Dzong, where two rivers meet.

4
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:16,815
It is often called the most beautiful fortress in the country.

5
00:00:17,865 --> 00:00:21,437
Do stop at Chimi Lhakhang, built in fourteen ninety-nine.

6
00:00:21,487 --> 00:00:23,152
It is the fertility temple.

7
00:00:24,202 --> 00:00:27,046
Do see the black-necked cranes in the Phobjika valley.

8
00:00:27,096 --> 00:00:29,939
They arrive from Tibet from late October to mid March.

9
00:00:30,989 --> 00:00:37,357
And do hike to the Tiger's Nest, a monastery clinging to a cliff about nine hundred meters above the Paro valley.

